mexicopoly-card-chance-top-property = Head out for a weekend getaway in { $destination }. Advance there now.
mexicopoly-card-chance-go = Your biweekly paycheck arrived early: advance to { $go } and collect your salary.
mexicopoly-card-chance-red-property = Take a road trip to { $destination }; collect the start-space salary if you pass { $go }.
mexicopoly-card-chance-pink-property = You are invited to a carne asada and mariachi night in { $destination }; collect the start-space salary if you pass { $go }.
mexicopoly-card-chance-nearest-transit = Your car broke down in heavy traffic: advance to the nearest { $transit }. If owned, pay twice the normal rent.
mexicopoly-card-chance-nearest-utility = Your utility service was cut for an overdue bill: advance to the nearest { $utility }. If owned, make a fresh rent roll and pay { $rate } per dice pip.
mexicopoly-card-chance-dividend = Annual company profit-sharing (PTU) arrived. Collect { $amount } from the Bank.
mexicopoly-card-chance-jail-free = A court injunction signed by a sharp lawyer: keep this Get Out of Jail Free card until needed or traded.
mexicopoly-card-chance-back-three = A street protest blocked the avenue: move back three spaces.
mexicopoly-card-chance-go-jail = Stopped at the El Torito checkpoint: go directly to { $jail } without collecting the { $go } salary.
mexicopoly-card-chance-repairs = Roof waterproofing and wall repairs after the rainy season: pay { $perHouse } per house and { $perHotel } per hotel for repairs.
mexicopoly-card-chance-speeding = Caught by a Periférico speed camera: pay a { $amount } fine.
mexicopoly-card-chance-named-transit = Catch the last train at { $destination }; collect the start-space salary if you pass { $go }.
mexicopoly-card-chance-chairperson = You were elected neighborhood committee president and had to buy the tortas and aguas frescas: pay each other player { $amount }.
mexicopoly-card-chance-loan = Your Infonavit housing credit paid off: collect { $amount }.
mexicopoly-card-chance-sat-audit = The SAT caught you with unpaid taxes and shady invoices! Pay { $percent }% of your cash (minimum { $minimum }) and go to { $jail } for { $turns } mandatory turns with no bail and no rent collection.
mexicopoly-card-chance-false-accusation = You were falsely accused of harassment on public transit and social media! While clearing up the gossip at the prosecutor's office, pay { $amount } in fines and legal fees.
mexicopoly-card-chance-alcoholimetro = You failed the breathalyzer test leaving the party: go directly to { $jail } without collecting the { $go } salary.
mexicopoly-card-chance-diablito-cfe = CFE inspectors found an illegal wiretap on your power meter: pay { $amount } in fines and reconnection fees.
mexicopoly-card-chance-verificacion-mordida = Your car failed the emissions check and traffic police fined you on top of it: pay { $amount }.
mexicopoly-card-chance-bache-llanta = You hit a giant pothole in the pouring rain and blew out two tires and a rim: pay { $amount } at the tire shop.
mexicopoly-card-chance-tanda-oficina = You drew the first payout number in the office savings pool (tanda)! Collect { $amount }.
mexicopoly-card-chance-cetes-buen-fin = Your CETES treasury bonds and Buen Fin cashback bonuses yielded record returns: collect { $amount }.
mexicopoly-card-chance-cobro-de-piso = Organized crime has started demanding protection money (cobro de piso)! Pay an immediate { $amount } fee, and all rents now suffer protection-racket deductions based on property development.
mexicopoly-card-chance-marina-operativo = The Mexican Navy carried out a raid and liberated all properties from the protection racket! You also collect a { $amount } civic reward.
mexicopoly-card-community-neighbor = Your neighbors organized a block workday and helped remodel your place. Collect { $amount }.
mexicopoly-card-community-path = You pitched in to fix the neighborhood sidewalks and streetlights. Collect { $amount }.
mexicopoly-card-community-blood = You donated blood at the clinic and got your juice box and sandwich. Collect { $amount }.
mexicopoly-card-community-bake-buy = You bought tamales and buñuelos at the elementary school festival. Pay { $amount }.
mexicopoly-card-community-jail-free = Connections at the civic court: keep this Get Out of Jail Free card until needed or traded.
mexicopoly-card-community-party = It is your birthday and you threw a taco party! Collect { $amount } from every other player for your gift.
mexicopoly-card-community-go-jail = Caught blocking street parking spots with cement buckets: go directly to { $jail } without collecting the { $go } salary.
mexicopoly-card-community-groceries = You ran the tianguis market errands for your grandma and she let you keep the change. Collect { $amount }.
mexicopoly-card-community-playground = You helped paint the neighborhood soccer court. Collect { $amount }.
mexicopoly-card-community-hospital = You volunteered at the local IMSS clinic. Collect { $amount }.
mexicopoly-card-community-car-wash = You tipped the street parking attendants and joined the neighborhood charity car wash. Pay { $amount }.
mexicopoly-card-community-race = Your full year-end aguinaldo bonus arrived: advance to { $go } and collect its salary.
mexicopoly-card-community-storm = You helped neighbors bail out water after a street flood. Collect { $amount }.
mexicopoly-card-community-shelter = You supported a neighborhood stray-dog shelter. Pay { $amount }.
mexicopoly-card-community-repairs = Extraordinary maintenance and facade painting assessment: pay { $perHouse } per house and { $perHotel } per hotel for repairs.
mexicopoly-card-community-bake-sale = Your street-fair antojitos and aguas frescas stand was a hit. Collect { $amount }.
mexicopoly-card-community-sat-refund = Tax miracle! The SAT sent you a higher-than-expected tax refund on your annual return. Collect { $amount }.
mexicopoly-card-community-falsa-denuncia-vecinal = A nosy neighbor filed a false harassment and noise complaint against you: pay { $amount } at the civic court to close the file.
mexicopoly-card-community-xv-anos = You were chosen as cake and sound-system godparent for a neighborhood quinceañera: pay each other player { $amount } for the party.
mexicopoly-card-community-rosca-tamales = You got the baby figurine in the Rosca de Reyes cake and had to buy the Candelaria tamales for everyone! Pay { $amount }.
mexicopoly-card-community-remesa-tio = Your uncle working up north sent a generous remittance: collect { $amount }.
mexicopoly-card-community-predial = Annual property tax (predial) and water bills arrived for your buildings: pay { $perHouse } per house and { $perHotel } per hotel.
mexicopoly-card-community-loteria-nacional = Your Lotería Nacional ticket hit a prize! Collect { $amount }.
mexicopoly-card-community-cancun-trip = You won an all-expenses-paid Caribbean trip to { $destination }; collect the start-space salary if you pass { $go }.
mexicopoly-card-community-cobro-de-piso = Extortionists arrived demanding protection fees from local businesses! Pay { $amount } immediately and activate the protection racket on all rents.
mexicopoly-card-community-marina-operativo = Joint Mexican Navy operation! The extortion ring was dismantled, all properties are freed from the protection racket, and you collect { $amount } in recovered funds.

